    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# How this automation works:\n\n1) Trigger starts when new quote is added onto google sheets\n2) If the client has not responded within 2 days, the AI Agent composes reminder email.\n3) Reminder email gets sent to client asking if they reject or still deciding\n4) If rejected then team gets notified via email. If still deciding then we wait 3 days.\n5) If still has not responded, then same job details gets pulled. Ensuring that the status is still pending\n6) Once confirmed, AI Agent composes final reminder and sent to client\n7) Whether the quote has been accepeted or declined, assigned member gets notified",
        "height": 352,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
